  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 703.02 Certificate of Commission. The certificate of commission shall contain the following:\n\n(a) Name of the railroad concerned;\n\n(b) Name and signature of the officer;\n\n(c) Name and signature of the commissioner;\n\n(d) The oath administered;\n\n(e) The date of the commission; and\n\n(f) The signature of the justice of the peace.\n\nSource. #2281, eff 1-16-83; ss by #2790, eff 8-2-84; ss by #5067, eff 2-21-91; ss by #6456, INTERIM, eff 2-21-97, EXPIRED: 6-21-97; ss by #6473, eff 3-25-97, EXPIRED: 3-25-05\n\nNew. #8776, eff 12-23-06; ss by #10889, eff 7-16-15",
